# git-crypt — encrypt sensitive in-development materials.
#
# Anything under `dev/` is treated as private and encrypted on stage; only the
# project owner's GPG key (registered via `git-crypt add-gpg-user`) can decrypt.
#
# `dev/README.md` is exempted so the public repo can show a plaintext note
# explaining why the directory is otherwise opaque.

dev/** filter=git-crypt diff=git-crypt
dev/README.md !filter !diff
